{"about_the_game":"You are Suzi and your best friend &quot;Ana&quot; is missing.<br>The only evidence you have is that &quot;Ana&quot; was seen near an abandoned house in the forest and the former owner of the property was killed by local residents for being accused of kidnapping and killing a girl.<br><br>The game is in the first person, walk freely around the house to explore.<br><br>Find ammunition to load your weapon, discover hidden messages on the walls and grab keys to unlock doors.<br><br>There are presences in the house that do not want your company.<br><br>Your enemies are: three possessed dolls and a creature with huge teeth.<br><br>The game has several Jump Scare.<br><br>Damn Dolls is a game of terror and suspense, its events occurred in the 80s.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main goal:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survive the dolls' attacks and eliminate the source of evil in order to leave the house.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"25a364fd5fe54a89f0cf64af0ccde7cbbe72962a.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome","name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1269240/25a364fd5fe54a89f0cf64af0ccde7cbbe72962a.jpg"},{"icon":"055043399e52722cf265ff0521fe07719a0cc993.jpg","localized_name":"Do not exceed","name":"Do not exceed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1269240/055043399e52722cf265ff0521fe07719a0cc993.jpg"},{"icon":"11c77842af167cac714edcf732cf1fc924d07c50.jpg","localized_name":"Playing with fire","name":"Playing with fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1269240/11c77842af167cac714edcf732cf1fc924d07c50.jpg"},{"icon":"7c6553794f8f868cd43692f63b8cbd5889c27e7d.jpg","localized_name":"Bob","name":"Bob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1269240/7c6553794f8f868cd43692f63b8cbd5889c27e7d.jpg"},{"icon":"b0d3fba5ba5b465ce28107842a831efd7a3fefa0.jpg","localized_name":"Jess","name":"Jess"